# English-only code comments

All comments in project source code must be written in **English**.

## Rules

- Use English for `//`, `/* */`, JSX `{/* */}`, and CSS `/* */` comments
- Use English for JSDoc/`TSDoc` (`/** ... */`)
- Do not write comments in Russian or any other non-English language
- User-facing UI copy may be Russian (Belarus market); comments are still English
- Prefer clear, concise comments that explain **why**, not obvious **what**

## Examples

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
// Получаем пользователя из базы
const user = await users.findById(id);

// ✅ GOOD
// Load user before applying personal pricing rules
const user = await users.findById(id);
```

```tsx
{/* ❌ BAD */}
{/* Блок профиля */}

{/* ✅ GOOD */}
{/* Public creator profile header */}
```

When editing existing files, translate non-English comments to English instead of leaving them as-is.
